Description: Remove catapult/typ entries from grit.pydeps
 The Debian Chromium tarball strips third_party/catapult entirely.
 The grit.pydeps file lists catapult/typ Python files as explicit ninja
 input dependencies (via the action_with_pydeps GN template). On a fresh
 build, ninja checks that all listed files exist before running any task;
 since catapult/typ is absent, the build fails immediately with "missing
 and no known rule to make it". The catapult/typ entries are only needed
 for the grit test runner (typ is a Python test framework), never for the
 production compilation path, so removing them is safe.
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <juan.mendezr@proton.me>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-04-07

